# ROVEXO Product Card v1.0 — CANONICAL LOCK

**STATUS: CANONICAL | SSOT | PLATFORM-WIDE**

One product listing card only: `components/ui/ListingCard.tsx`  
One prop bundle: `LISTING_CARD_HOMEPAGE_PROPS` / `HP_CANONICAL_LISTING_PROPS` / `ROVEXO_PRODUCT_CARD_PROPS`

## Required fields

Image · Favourite ♥ · Price · Incl. total · Title · Condition · ★ rating · Views · click → product page

## Forbidden

Parallel cards (Search/Favourites/Seller/Related/Recommended/Category v2–v4), seller name/location on the card, duplicate CSS/components/routes.

## Rule

Every product grid must spread `{...LISTING_CARD_HOMEPAGE_PROPS}` or `{...HP_CANONICAL_LISTING_PROPS}` with `surface: "homepage"`. Do not override `surface` to a parallel visual.
